"the right side in this field as a negative value in pixels."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1015
msgid ""
"The layer’s minimum width. Setting a value prevents the layer from becoming "
"smaller than specified. Supported units: <br><br> <b>px:</b> A fixed value "
"specified in pixels. <br><br> <b>%:</b> Percentage of the entire project "
"width. <br><br> <b>em:</b> Relative to the layer’s font size. If the layer’s "
"font size is 36px, 1em will translate into exactly 36 pixels, while 1.5em "
"will be 54px. <br><br> <b>rem:</b> The same as <b>em</b>, but it’s relative "
"to the global font size set on the &lt;html&gt; root element."
