#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1467
msgid ""
"Sets how many slices the layer is cut into. Fewer slices create bold, chunky "
"fragments, while more slices produce a finer, smoother scattering. You can "
"use up to 20 slices."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1471
msgid ""
"Determines how the layer is cut and which way the slices travel. Diagonal "
"options produce angled cuts, while Vertical and Horizontal split the layer "
"into straight columns or rows."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1475
msgid ""
"Controls how far each slice travels from its original position, measured in "
"pixels. Larger values create a more dramatic, widely scattered result. "
"Neighboring slices move in opposite directions, so the layer pulls itself "
"apart. Randomized values are also supported, in which case every slice "
"receives its own value from the defined range."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1479
msgid ""
"Sets the scale each slice grows or shrinks to while it travels. Values above "
"1 make slices end up enlarged, while values below 1 make them end up "
"smaller. Randomized values are also supported, in which case every slice "
"receives its own value from the defined range."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-smart-help.php:1483
msgid ""
"Adds spacing between the slices in pixels, trimming each slice along its "
